# CVE-2026-23949 — jaraco.context path traversal via malicious tar archive.
# This app never processes user-supplied tar archives at runtime; not exploitable.
CVE-2026-23949

# CVE-2026-24049 — wheel privilege escalation via malicious wheel file.
# wheel is a build-time tool; the runtime image never installs wheel files from
# untrusted sources. Not exploitable in this deployment context.
CVE-2026-24049

# CVE-2026-33671 — picomatch ReDoS via crafted extglob patterns.
# The frontend runner image is a Next.js standalone bundle; no glob matching
# is exposed to untrusted input at runtime.
CVE-2026-33671
